/*!
   \qmlmodule org.kde.kirigamiaddons.dateandtime
   \title Kirigami Addons DateAndTime QML Types
   \brief QML types for selecting dates and times.

   Use \l DatePopup to select a date, or \l TimePopup to select a time in a
   dialog. \l TimePicker provides a time selection control that can also be
   embedded in another interface.
 */
